ml": "<p>In music, <b>timbre</b>, also known as <b>tone color</b> or <b>tone quality</b>, is the perceived sound of a musical note, sound or tone. Timbre distinguishes sounds according to their source, such as choir voices and musical instruments. It also enables listeners to distinguish instruments in the same category.</p>"}